## Employee
Self-referencing hierarchy: manager_id points to another Employee. NULL manager_id indicates top-level (CEO/root).
Forms an org chart tree — no cycles allowed (enforced by application, not DB constraint).

## Evaluation
Two FK references to Employee on the same entity: employee_id (subject) and evaluator_id (reviewer).
An employee cannot evaluate themselves (enforced by application logic, not DB constraint).

## Department
head_id is a required FK to Employee — every department must have a designated head.
Circular dependency: Employee belongs to org structure, Department references Employee as head.
